      - Parameters regarding theta estimation:
         - Will store all required data in memory. (use 'useTmpFile' to write to a file instead)
         - Will only infer theta for windows with at least 1000 sites with data. (parameter 'minSitesWithData')
         - Will only write minimal output during theta EM runs. (request extra output with 'extraVerbose')
         - Will estimate base frequencies. (use 'equalBaseFreqs' to assume equal base frequencies)
         - Parameters of EM algorithm to infer theta:
            - Will run up to 100 iterations. (parameter 'iterations')
            - In each iteration, theta will be updated 10 times. (parameter 'iterationsThetaOnly')
            - Will run EM until deltaLL < 1e-06. (parameter 'maxEps')
            - Will run Newton-Raphson algorithm up to 10 times. (parameter 'NRiterations')
            - Will run Newton-Raphson algorithm until max(F) < 1e-05. (parameter 'maxF')
