            - Will start with an initial theta of 0.01. (parameter 'initTheta')
            - Will run 10 iterations of a crude search for an initial theta. (parameter 'initThetaNumSearchIterations')
            - The initial search factor will be 100. (parameter 'initThetaSearchFactor')
